{
  "job_C26.1_20251003_115243": {
    "text": "Abraham exemplum fideliter credentium fuit Her godes swy\u00f0ra forbead Abrahame, \u00fe\u00e6t he his sunu ne\nUbi quinque reges predati sunt Loth Her \u00f0as fif kynegas bereafodon Loth \u00e6t his \u00e6hton.\nAbram post praedones currit Her Abraham ferde \u00e6fter \u00f0am kynegon, \u00f0e Loth bereafodon.\nAbram devictis hostibus recepto Loth cum victoria revertitur Her Abraham gewunnenum sige ferde\nUbi Abram decimas offert et Melchisedech Habrahae panem et vinum, Melchisedech rex et sacerdos dei\nUbi tres angeli apparent Abrahe in convalle Mambre Her \u00e6teowdon \u00f0ry englas Abrahame on \u00f0am dene,\nPrudentius orat Her Prudentius hine gebitt on naman.\nFides secura adhuc belli ignara idolatriam repugnat prima Her se geleafa fiht ongean \u00f0a deofolgyld.\nFides conculcat idolatriam.\nFides post victoriam virtutes coronat Her se geleafa \u00e6fter gewunnenum sige gewuldorbeaga\u00f0 \u00f0a mihta.\nPudicitia contra libidinem armis pugnat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys fiht ongean \u00f0a galnysse.\nPudicitia libidinem cum saxo percutit Her seo cl\u00e6nnys wyrp\u00f0 \u00fea galnysse mid stane.\nPudicitia libidinem transfigit gladio Her seo cl\u00e6nnys \u00f0urh\u00f0y\u00f0 \u00fea galnysse mid swurde.\nPudicitia libidinem extinctam increpat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys \u00f0rea\u00f0 \u00fea adwescedan galnysse.\nSancta pudicitia gladium purificat Her seo cl\u00e6nnys a\u00f0woh hyre swurd on \u00f0\u00e6re ea Iordane.\nPudicitia gladium suum sub altare in templo recondit Her seo cl\u00e6nnys behyt hyre swurd on \u00f0am\nUbi patientia inter acies vitiorum intrepida stat Her \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld stent unforht betweonan \u00f0ara leahtra\nIra patientiam conto percutit Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre slih\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld mid his spere.\nIra patientiam increpat Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00f0rea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld.\nIra lanceam suam iacit contra patientiam Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre scyt his spere ongean \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld.\nArma fracta, quae miserat ira contra patientiam Her synd \u00f0a w\u00e6pna tobrocene, \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t yrre scet ongean\nIra patientiam gladio percutit Her slih\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld.\nGladius ire frangitur in capite patientiae Her w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6s yrres swurd tobrocen in \u00f0\u00e6s ge\u00f0yldes heafde.\nIra se sagitta interficit Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre ofslih\u00f0 hit sylf mid his swurde beforan \u00f0am ge\u00f0ylde.\nPatientia victrix iram mortuam increpat Her \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld \u00f0rea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t deade yrre.\nPatientia cum Iob medias acies transit Her \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld mid Iobe \u00f0am halgan \u00f0urhferde \u00f0ara leahtra\nPatientia cum Iob loquitur Her \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld sprec\u00f0 to Iobe.\nPatientia devictis vitiis ad virtutes loquitur Her \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0yld oferswi\u00f0\u00f0um leahtrum sprec\u00f0 to \u00f0am\nSuperbia in turmas effreni volitat aequo Her seo modinys rit into \u00fe\u00e6t folc on ungemidlodon horse.\nSuperbia aequitat Her seo modinys rit.\nSuperbia in equo minatur turbis, humilitas et spes intrepidae stant Her seo modinys on horse \u00f0yw\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nSuperbia inruere vult super humilitatem et spem Her seo modinys wyle offeallan \u00f0a eadmodnysse and\nSuperbia cadit in fovem Her seo modinys feal\u00f0 on \u00f0one sea\u00f0.\nHumilitas deridet superbiam iacentem Her seo eadmodnys gebysmra\u00f0 \u00fea licgendan modinysse.\nSuperbia iacit humilitati spes offert gladium Her seo modinys li\u00f0, and se hiht byt his swurd \u00f0\u00e6re\nHumilitas amputat caput superbiae Her seo eadmodnys heaw\u00f0 of \u00f0\u00e6re modinysse heafod.\nHumilitas caput superbiae offert spei Her seo eadmodnys byt \u00f0an hihte \u00f0\u00e6re modinysse heafod.\nExtinctam superbiam spes increpat Her se hiht \u00f0rea\u00f0 \u00fea adw\u00e6scedan modinysse.\nHumilitas ascendit in caelum, virtutes mirantur eam Her seo eadmodnys astih\u00f0 to heofonan \u00f0am o\u00f0rum\nLuxuria in caena sedit Her seo galnys sit on hyre gebeorscipe.\nLuxuria auditis tubis ad bellum currit Her seo galnys arn to gefeohte, \u00f0a heo \u00f0a byman gehyrde.\nLuxuriam mirantur viri in curru Her \u00fe\u00e6t folc wundra\u00f0, hu seo galnys f\u00e6r\u00f0 on hyre cr\u00e6te.\nLuxuria blandimentis virtutes decipit Her seo galnys bep\u00e6c\u00f0 \u00f0a mihta mid hyre gesw\u00e6snyssum.\nViri deiectis armis sequuntur luxuriam Her \u00fe\u00e6t folc lede his w\u00e6pna and filide \u00f0\u00e6re galnysse.\nCuncta acies versis signis ad deditionem transit Eal \u00fe\u00e6t gaderunge mid gewende tacen to \u00f0e galnesse\nSobrietas increpat acies dicens, ne sequantur luxuriam Her sy syfernesse \u00f0am folce mid worde ge\u00f0rea\u00f0.\nSobrietas crucem domini offert currui luxuriae Her seo seofernysse bere\u00f0 Cristes rode ongean \u00f0eas\nSobrietas lapidem iacit et percutit os luxuriae Her seo syfernesse werp\u00f0 \u00f0a galnesse mid stane.\nMultitudinem vitiorum avaritia nigro lacte nutrit Her seo galnese tytrode hir cyn on hire sylfre.\nAvaritia stupefacta fatescit Her se iytsere.\nDiscordia virtutibus insidiatur et capitur Her hi suf.",
